add_claim("THE SELECTIVE CAREER SET, spelled out: 'Win Legendary division **Home matches only**... **Do not play Global challenge cup** (nor home nor away) - because the matches are way too many. **International cup and All star cup all matches**... I only play diamond cup when there is **career objective of reaching final of diamond cup**!'", 3, "career/selective-match-set", [e_cg])
