add_claim("THE FULL GEM-SOURCE BUDGET, from a community accounting: **DLL 6,000 · Progress Bank 1,640 · daily + weekly challenges 897 · Season Pass 300 · clans 275 · DP ladder 215 · DLL leaderboard 100 · DLL challenges 180.** So DLL is by far the dominant source and the clan system is worth roughly 275 gems a season - which is the correct weight to give it against the 1,125-gem facility decisions.", 3, "economy/full-gem-source-budget", [e_cg])
